    <title>Intake CVTC Target - Cold</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x170A2; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Mode 3 intake-cam target of the VVEL selector, interpolated by the coolant-coded byte of the cold axis. Stock values are 0x8000 = 0 at every point. Exact 1ND3B target-native table at 0x170a2 bound to accessor 0x5f468 through literal 0x5f7bc. Read by the resolver FUN_0005F468 at callsite 0x5F6EC through the 8-point uint16 wrapper 0x28910 with its own literal pool word. Stock bytes are identical to JK78C 0x00016A94. 1ND3B shares the 1ND0A code layout and its stock bytes at this address.</description>
