    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x17202; 2 rows x 8 columns; uint16; map confidence code. Native VQ37 fuel-cut activation and release curves. Common-definition Map 1 uses the canonical stock storage. Exact 1ND3B native fuel-cut model at 0x76ad2; selector 0xfffe80ed, shared axis 0x17072. The complete 1ND3B fuel-cut function and every address-bearing pointer binding are byte-identical to 1ND0A. The independent stock-image hash and calibration bytes remain target-bound. The two rows are interpolated independently; no interpolation occurs between rows.</description>
