  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x6283" flags="0x0">
    <title>Map 3 - Ignition Timing Surface - High-Octane State</title>
    <description>Exact 1ND3B. Address 0x132600; 16 rows x 16 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. High-octane hot timing-state surface. It supplies active sample ffff160f when ffff2466.bit6 is clear and remains reference sample ffff1610 when that selector is set. Coordinator 000493e8 also looks it up independently for the conditional signed Q8 difference against 0x9B1A. Common-definition Map 3 storage is projected from 0x9980. Stock firmware does not reference this allocated storage; it becomes runtime-active only with the project map-switching patch. This view edits mask 0x7F and preserves the other bits in each cell. The physical name matches homolog EV18A 0x9a76. The low-seven field is a crank-degree adjustment added to the computed base angle ffff23f1, not a direct absolute spark angle; coordinator 000493e8 also forms the conditional signed Q8 difference against 0x9B1A from the same field. The unit closure is the arithmetic chain to the J1979 PID 0x0E coordinate: ffff23bd=max(low7-ffff11af,0) at 0004af84; ffff1830=clamp_s8(ffff23f1+ffff23bd-ffff23c5-ffff12dc-ffff15ea-128+ffff1a7d+ffff134a) at 0004bee2, where ffff1a7d is centered at 64 so the map field enters as low7-64 beside base angle ffff23f1; ffff2404=ffff1830 at 0004c17a; scheduler 00020dfe copies ffff2404 to snapshot ffff2378 at 00021314..00021318; ffff12d6=clamp_s8(ffff2378+ffff11d6+ffff2356-ffff1ff6) at 0004db8c; ffff11da=clamp(ffff12d6+gated ffff564c,-7,50) at 0004dcf6; the rate-limited and bounded result is ffff11d4 at 0004df64, which PID 0x0E publishes as A/2-64 degBTDC. Every coefficient is 1, so one raw count is one crank degree while the field stays above threshold ffff11af, and raw 64 is the zero adjustment. The physical spark angle remains a hardware item. Definition address projected from JK08A 00009a1a through JK08A-1ND.definition-addresses.csv: target ignition selector preserves the first source branch as branch 1.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="14" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x1398A" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedcolcount="16" mmedmajorstridebits="8" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>Normalized BFS [%] [cand]</units>
